        "Description": "Good Day 47,\r\rHey! Ho! Here we go!  \rTargets lined up, put on a show!  \rHey! Ho! Watch them drop!  \rIt’s time for some **Blitzkrieg Pop!**\r\rMove real fast, don’t stop the beat,  \rFive little targets, all nice and neat!  \rHey! Ho! Let’s make it pop!  \rOne by one, they’re gonna drop!\r\rSo grab your gear and hit the spot,  \rGive ’em a finale they’ll never forgot!  \rHey! Ho! Don’t stop!  \rWelcome to **Blitzkrieg Pop!**\r\rGood l\rLuck.\r\rBy - SW",
